  "statuteText": "263:54 Revocation and Suspension for Nonresidents. –\n\nThe director may suspend or revoke the right of any nonresident owner or driver to drive or have driven in this state, any motor vehicle, for the same causes and under the same conditions that he can take like action against resident owners and drivers in this state."
